# ROS2 Communication Standards

## Topic Naming

Format: `/<namespace>/<category>/<specific>`, e.g. `/robot/sensors/lidar/scan`, `/robot/control/cmd_vel`, `/robot/state/odometry`.

| Rule | Example |
|------|---------|
| Use lowercase | `/robot/cmd_vel` |
| Underscores for multi-word | `/joint_states` |
| Avoid abbreviations | `/camera/image` not `/cam/img` |
| Use namespaces | `/robot1/cmd_vel` |
| Be descriptive | `/laser_scan` not `/ls` |

## QoS Profiles

```python
SENSOR_QOS = QoSProfile(reliability=QoSReliabilityPolicy.BEST_EFFORT,
                         durability=QoSDurabilityPolicy.VOLATILE,
                         history=QoSHistoryPolicy.KEEP_LAST, depth=5)

CONTROL_QOS = QoSProfile(reliability=QoSReliabilityPolicy.RELIABLE,
                          durability=QoSDurabilityPolicy.VOLATILE,
                          history=QoSHistoryPolicy.KEEP_LAST, depth=10)

STATE_QOS = QoSProfile(reliability=QoSReliabilityPolicy.RELIABLE,
                        durability=QoSDurabilityPolicy.TRANSIENT_LOCAL,
                        history=QoSHistoryPolicy.KEEP_LAST, depth=1)
```

| Data Type | Reliability | Durability | Depth | Example |
|-----------|-------------|------------|-------|---------|
| Sensor (high freq) | BEST_EFFORT | VOLATILE | 1-5 | LiDAR, Camera |
| Commands | RELIABLE | VOLATILE | 10 | cmd_vel |
| State/Config | RELIABLE | TRANSIENT_LOCAL | 1 | robot_description |
| Transforms | RELIABLE | VOLATILE | 100 | tf |
| Map | RELIABLE | TRANSIENT_LOCAL | 1 | occupancy_grid |

QoS compatibility: a RELIABLE publisher and a BEST_EFFORT subscriber (or vice versa) do not connect, this fails silently (no error, no crash), just no data on the topic. Check both ends with `ros2 topic info <topic> --verbose` when a subscription looks correctly wired but never receives anything.

## Custom Message / Service / Action

```
# msg/RobotState.msg
std_msgs/Header header
geometry_msgs/Point position
geometry_msgs/Quaternion orientation
geometry_msgs/Twist velocity
uint8 STATUS_IDLE = 0
uint8 STATUS_MOVING = 1
uint8 STATUS_ERROR = 2
uint8 status
float32 battery_level
float64[] sensor_readings
```

```
# srv/SetRobotMode.srv
---
uint8 MODE_MANUAL = 0
uint8 MODE_AUTO = 1
uint8 MODE_EMERGENCY = 2
uint8 mode
string[] parameters
---
bool success
string message
float64 transition_time
```

```
# action/NavigateToGoal.action
---
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose
float32 max_velocity
bool allow_replanning
---
bool success
string message
float64 total_time
float64 total_distance
---
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped current_pose
float32 distance_remaining
float32 estimated_time_remaining
uint8 recovery_count
```

## Message Package CMakeLists.txt

```cmake
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.8)
project(robot_interfaces)

find_package(ament_cmake REQUIRED)
find_package(rosidl_default_generators REQUIRED)
find_package(std_msgs REQUIRED)
find_package(geometry_msgs REQUIRED)
find_package(action_msgs REQUIRED)

rosidl_generate_interfaces(${PROJECT_NAME}
  "msg/RobotState.msg"
  "srv/SetRobotMode.srv"
  "action/NavigateToGoal.action"
  DEPENDENCIES std_msgs geometry_msgs action_msgs
)

ament_export_dependencies(rosidl_default_runtime)
ament_package()
```

## TF2 Transform Broadcasting

```python
import tf2_ros

class TransformPublisher:
    def __init__(self, node):
        self._node = node
        self._static_broadcaster = tf2_ros.StaticTransformBroadcaster(node)
        self._dynamic_broadcaster = tf2_ros.TransformBroadcaster(node)
```
